    <h2 id="legit-heading">Experience you can rely on</h2>
    <p>Friendly doesn't mean amateur. Here's the background behind the help you get.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>A BSc in Multimedia Computing.</strong></li>
      <li><strong>More than 25 years in IT and digital.</strong> Websites, servers, networks and security.</li>
      <li><strong>13 years in London tech</strong>, building and running systems for organisations such as Barclays, British Airways and HSBC.</li>
      <li><strong>Still learning.</strong> Technology changes constantly, so I keep my knowledge up to date.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You get the know-how of someone who has looked after systems for major banks and airlines, explained calmly and clearly in your own home.</p>
  </div>
</section>

